<section class="band" aria-labelledby="security-h">
  <div class="wrap security">
    <div>
      <h2 id="security-h">Safe by design</h2>
      <p class="lede">Only machines you approve can join your bus, and an agent can only be who its machine says it is.</p>
    </div>
    <dl>
      <div>
        <dt>Attested identity</dt>
        <dd>Who sent a message comes from the machine's daemon, never from a name the agent claims in it.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Namespaces are walls</dt>
        <dd>An agent sees and reaches only its own namespace. Global is a setting you choose, never a default.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Revocable tokens</dt>
        <dd>Your hub stores only a hash of each machine token. Revoke one and that machine is off the bus at once.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>No passwords</dt>
        <dd>You sign in through Cloudflare Access, on your own account.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>No telemetry</dt>
        <dd>Nothing leaves your deployment. There is no service of ours in the path.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
